  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.berkeleyside.org/2026/09/11/the-wire-berkeley-lab-scientists-find-strong-sign-of-dark-matter-art-for-fire-safe-yards#main\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Skip to content</a></p>\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n<figure><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/newspack-berkeleyside-cityside.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP22187767532159.jpg?resize=780%2C439&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"780\" height=\"439\" /><figcaption>Aaron Manalaysay, physics coordinator at the Lawrence Berkeley National Lab, explains how an underground detector will interact with dark matter in the Sanford Underground Research Facility in Lead, S.D., on Dec. 8, 2019. Credit: AP/Stephen Groves</figcaption></figure>\n\n<p><em>Heads up: We sometimes link to sites that limit access to non-subscribers.</em></p>\n\n<p><strong>Berkeley Lab scientists</strong> have found the strongest sign yet of dark matter. (<a href=\"https://www.newsweek.com/scientists-detect-strongest-sign-yet-of-dark-matter-breakthrough-12395799\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Newsweek</a>, <a href=\"https://www.dailycal.org/news/campus/research-and-ideas/berkeley-lab-scientists-may-be-one-step-closer-to-unraveling-a-dark-cosmic-mystery/article_d9eaa025-31a4-47e4-b611-fb0f4a73c640.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Cal</a>)</p>\n\n<p><strong>About a dozen tents have caught fire</strong> in Berkeley’s Harrison Street homeless encampment since the start of the year. (<a href=\"https://www.berkeleyscanner.com/2026/09/10/community/fires-plague-berkeley-homeless-camp-harrison-street/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Berkeley Scanner</a>)</p>\n\n<p><strong>A new exhibit at Berkeley’s ACCI Gallery</strong> offers noncombustible art for fire-safe yards. (<a href=\"https://www.berkeleyscanner.com/2026/09/08/community/can-fire-safe-yards-be-beautiful-berkeley-gallery-says-yes/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Berkeley Scanner</a>)</p>\n\n<p><strong>A student backlash is brewing</strong> after the Chicanx Latinx Student Development director  was placed on administrative leave. (<a href=\"https://www.dailycal.org/news/campus/uc-berkeley-students-devastated-after-chicanx-latinx-student-development-director-placed-on-administrative-leave/article_0917f805-d0eb-497d-b2d5-e245d4ad5fe7.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Cal</a>)</p>\n\n<p><strong>A Jewish photographer’s secretive trove</strong> of portraits of icons are on display in full for the first time at the Magnes Collection in downtown Berkeley. (<a href=\"https://jweekly.com/2026/09/09/hidden-for-decades-a-photographers-tribute-to-her-idols-opens-at-magnes/?utm_source=J.+The+Jewish+News+of+Northern+California&amp;utm_campaign=f2c022023d-RSS_EMAIL_CAMPAIGN-WJ-090826&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_93a945700b-f394910354-216677151\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">J. The Jewish News of Northern California</a>)</p>\n\n<p><strong>UC Berkeley has lost its spot in the top 5</strong> on Forbes’ list of the nation’s best colleges but remains the top-ranked public institution. (<a href=\"https://www.sfgate.com/bayarea/article/forbes-best-colleges-california-22426542.php\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">SFGATE</a>)</p>\n\n<p><strong>A sex education convention</strong> to teach men to flirt is coming to Berkeley. (<a href=\"https://www.dailycal.org/news/city/slutcon-coming-to-berkeley-a-sex-education-convention-to-teach-men-to-flirt/article_4885435e-db13-40be-8b20-4d7077c12781.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Cal</a>)</p>\n\n\n\n\n                        <p>\"*\" indicates required fields</p>\n                        \t\n\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\